/mvnw text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Keep SQL migrations and Java sources as LF everywhere, so Flyway migration
# checksums (and diffs) stay stable across Windows/git line-ending conversion.
# Without this, CRLF<->LF flips change a migration's checksum and Flyway fails
# validation on the next startup even though the migration content is unchanged.
*.sql text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
